{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"alias":"deprived-candid-elephant","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Run gold-set evaluations of Nova-class and comparable lower-cost models for operations currently on Sonnet (completion verifier, plan-review verification passes, LMN drafting/verification). Adopt only where quality holds, per the tiering-with-evaluation-gates principle. Acceptance: documented evaluation results per operation; migration only for operations that pass; unit-cost deltas recorded.","id":"05a2-196c-0f30-4606","parent_id":"887c-009e-bc96-48c8","priority":2,"tags":["cost"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Evaluate lower-cost models for Sonnet-tier operations"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1789406144515465001,"uuid":"694c891f-352c-4144-ad94-3a526a2d9bbc"}